Suite: Quotes

Vocabulary:
  State: the quote is none | shown
    Shows: none: the screen says "No quote yet"
    Shows: shown: the screen shows a firm price
  Event: the user asks for a quote
    Say: tap Get quote
  Event: the user dismisses the quote
    Say: tap Dismiss

Background:
  Given the quote is none

Feature: Quotes
  Approval: approved

  You ask for a quote before you buy, and the app shows a firm price from the quote service.
  Dismiss it and ask again for a fresh one.

  Expectation: Asking shows a quote
    Given the quote is none
    When the user asks for a quote
    Then the quote is shown

  Expectation: Dismissing clears it
    Given the quote is shown
    When the user dismisses the quote
    Then the quote is none

Story: Get a quote
  Approval: approved
  As a buyer
  I want a price before I commit
  So that I know what I will pay

  You open the app and ask for a quote. The app asks the quote service, and shows the firm
  price it sends. If you want a fresh price, dismiss it and ask again.

  Scenario: Ask, dismiss, ask again
    When the user asks for a quote
    Then the quote is shown
    When the user dismisses the quote
    Then the quote is none
    When the user asks for a quote
    Then the quote is shown
